</tbody></table>

<div style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</div>

<div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">Proposal 2. The Company&#8217;s stockholders approved the BIO-key International, Inc. 2023 Stock Incentive Plan.&#xa0; The final voting results were as follows:</div>

